title: OpenAI Platform: Project usage
agents: openai_platform
catalog: app
license: GPLv2
distribution: checkmk-openai extension
description: Shows provider-reported usage for one project in the configured aggregation window. Usage is dynamic workload data; optional thresholds are disabled by default. Usage documentation: https://help.openai.com/en/articles/10478918-reviewing-api-usage-and-costs.
item: OpenAI project name.
discovery: Project usage service discovery can be enabled or disabled with the OpenAI Platform project service discovery rule.  One service is discovered for each project returned by OpenAI.
